      "Corrected b003.c2 and b003.c3 routes so every required semantic component is directly supported by the unchanged frozen sources; v0.1.2 remains the preserved over-specified baseline.",
      "Replaced only bench_002's truncated ALCE capture with immutable snapshot bench_002_20261018_v2, which contains the complete official arXiv PDF text and citation-recall definition; all earlier datasets and snapshots remain unchanged.",
      "Replaced only bench_002's physical-layout PDF extraction with immutable snapshot bench_002_20261018_v3. The same official ALCE PDF is stored in linear reading order so exact continuous Reader quotes are not interrupted by the other column.",
      "Completed bench_002's primary-source repair with immutable snapshot bench_002_20261018_v4: ALCE and RAGTruth are now complete reading-order PDF extractions, including the full four-class RAGTruth taxonomy.",
      "Corrected b001.c2 to the exact frozen-source semantics: shared memory saves state and evidence, reduces duplicate retrieval, and lets later Agents trace conclusions to evidence; it no longer overstates this as generic cross-Agent reuse."
